1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
I recently handled a case

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,200
about toxic managers and employees.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,000
I'll tell you about it.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,100
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad, psychologist.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,200
A young guy I know,

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,800
who was very smart,

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,300
landed a top MNC job

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,200
at a very young age.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
While he was working,

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,300
everyone around him

11
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,300
was much older than him.

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,100
As he performed really well

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,800
and excelled at his work,

14
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:35,100
his salary got hiked regularly.

15
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,800
Compared to others,

16
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,000
he earned double the salary.

17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,100
Out of extreme jealousy,

18
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,100
they constantly criticized him.

19
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,900
He faced vulgar language,

20
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:50,800
abuse, and harassment.

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,600
As a result of this,

22
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,700
he fell into severe depression.

23
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,100
Then he came to me

24
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,100
for psychological counseling.

25
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,100
When I analyzed

26
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,900
why he ended up like this,

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,800
it was the toxic environment.

28
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,000
He joined enthusiastically,

29
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,300
being a knowledgeable,

30
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:14,500
friendly, and happy person.

31
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:17,200
But their relentless push

32
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,200
to drive him out

33
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,900
severely impacted his life.

